            1487     1   p    v            prsl(kk)=sigma(k,2)+sigma(k+1,2)
            1488     1   p    v            prsl(kk)=prsl(kk)+(sigma(k,1)+sigma(k+1,1))*1000.
            1489     1   p    v            prsl(kk)=0.5*prsl(kk)/1000.
